WEBVTT

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:06.982
I had my graduation ceremony today.

00:00:06.982 --> 00:00:10.474
I had my graduation ceremony today.

00:00:25.433 --> 00:00:27.765
Here, you see?

00:00:31.306 --> 00:00:33.297
Amadeus...

00:00:50.091 --> 00:00:55.797
In my younger days, I lost

00:00:55.797 --> 00:01:01.670
even the reason for this pain

00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:07.342
Crouching over, making excuses

00:01:07.342 --> 00:01:10.539
I must have...

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:18.286
Taking hold of the premonition
I saw at the end of the blue,

00:01:18.286 --> 00:01:25.861
riding the wind, I'm off
to where the light shines

00:01:25.861 --> 00:01:28.730
I'll always be with you

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:31.233
see the sky in front of you

00:01:31.233 --> 00:01:35.636
fly high in a light from the deepest blue

00:01:37.405 --> 00:01:42.978
Riding the echo of swirling stars,

00:01:42.978 --> 00:01:45.580
I sing out

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:54.249
May my voice reach you

00:02:05.533 --> 00:02:10.071
Receiving eyewitness reports of
the Album in the Moon city's sector 1.

00:02:10.071 --> 00:02:13.575
They are heading there at once.

00:02:13.575 --> 00:02:20.582
City sector 1... The Moon city's
only multi-compound rest facility...

00:02:20.582 --> 00:02:23.351
It reutilizes the generators
and energy supplies needed

00:02:23.351 --> 00:02:26.087
during the first stage of the
lunar colonization project,

00:02:26.087 --> 00:02:29.190
when the underground city
was constructed five years ago.

00:02:29.190 --> 00:02:32.093
The assimilation system that
handled their waste issues

00:02:32.093 --> 00:02:35.030
was rebuilt into a warm-water supply.

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:38.533
Carrying on the warm frontier spirit
of the start of the project,

00:02:38.533 --> 00:02:40.602
their grand sense of purpose was...

00:02:40.602 --> 00:02:44.732
In other words, it's a hot spring...
a spa resort, right?

00:02:46.908 --> 00:02:51.379
The hot springs sure are nice.
I'd like to go there myself!

00:02:51.379 --> 00:02:53.281
Why don't we go together,
the next vacation we have?

00:02:53.281 --> 00:02:54.883
We'll buy new swimsuits.

00:02:54.883 --> 00:02:57.786
Just us girls? That seems sort of lonesome.

00:02:57.786 --> 00:03:01.289
What do you mean? You don't have
anyone to show them off to anyhow.

00:03:01.289 --> 00:03:02.916
Now, now...

00:03:23.445 --> 00:03:25.276
Here it comes!

00:03:26.448 --> 00:03:28.616
Oh, no!

00:03:28.616 --> 00:03:31.642
Is this the first time for you two?

00:03:34.756 --> 00:03:38.426
The hot springs. Or rather, a spa.

00:03:38.426 --> 00:03:39.995
Yeah.

00:03:39.995 --> 00:03:43.658
Obviously. I was just barely born.

00:03:50.505 --> 00:03:53.030
I hope things are going all right for Toa.

00:03:54.309 --> 00:03:56.140
Here you go.

00:03:57.278 --> 00:03:58.847
Spa resort?

00:03:58.847 --> 00:04:02.977
The hot springs over there.
You should go before you get the sniffles.

00:04:07.055 --> 00:04:10.325
A love triangle, with a pretty
young girl in the middle.

00:04:10.325 --> 00:04:13.123
I wonder how this will turn out.

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:18.133
Do you know about the little mermaid?

00:04:18.133 --> 00:04:23.071
The little mermaid gets herself
a human body from an old witch,

00:04:23.071 --> 00:04:25.904
so that she can see her beloved prince.

00:04:28.209 --> 00:04:31.579
But in return, she loses her voice.

00:04:31.579 --> 00:04:33.681
Toa, what are you...

00:04:33.681 --> 00:04:37.552
And then, when the little mermaid
isn't able to marry the prince,

00:04:37.552 --> 00:04:40.522
she becomes sea foam, and disappears.

00:04:40.522 --> 00:04:46.194
Mermaids and people
cannot join. Neither can we.

00:04:46.194 --> 00:04:48.496
That's not true.

00:04:48.496 --> 00:04:52.333
Being a Dragon or a person
doesn't make any difference.

00:04:52.333 --> 00:04:57.605
I mean, Toa, you made me
realize that I'm not alone.

00:04:57.605 --> 00:04:59.232
Jin...

00:05:02.077 --> 00:05:03.704
Gio...

00:05:07.115 --> 00:05:11.609
I came all the way here because
I wanted to protect Toa. But...

00:05:12.887 --> 00:05:14.923
What good does it do to protect the Album?

00:05:14.923 --> 00:05:17.959
Once she gets back together
with that Kamishina Jin guy,

00:05:17.959 --> 00:05:21.262
you'll be the one who's in the way!

00:05:21.262 --> 00:05:23.965
In the way?

00:05:23.965 --> 00:05:28.236
I don't understand why I want to protect Toa.

00:05:28.236 --> 00:05:31.205
What am I to Toa?

00:05:32.807 --> 00:05:36.244
Let's just get in there so that
the Album doesn't notice us.

00:05:36.244 --> 00:05:39.047
Act "speedy and smart."

00:05:39.047 --> 00:05:43.151
Make sure not to cause any
disturbances that involve the civilians.

00:05:43.151 --> 00:05:44.778
Got it?

00:05:47.922 --> 00:05:50.254
Okay, you're on.

00:05:53.595 --> 00:05:54.229
"Men"

00:05:54.229 --> 00:05:56.064
"Men"
Where is Raina-sama going?

00:05:56.064 --> 00:05:56.598
"Men"
Who knows?

00:05:56.598 --> 00:05:57.232
Who knows?

00:05:57.232 --> 00:05:59.894
He has some other mission to carry out.

00:06:00.835 --> 00:06:02.427
"Women"

00:06:03.304 --> 00:06:05.773
Yow!

00:06:05.773 --> 00:06:09.937
You're pathetic, letting
Kamishina Jin get away from you.

00:06:11.446 --> 00:06:15.450
Oh, don't be so hard on me.
I just let my guard down.

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:17.452
The worst mistake of Souya Akira's life.

00:06:17.452 --> 00:06:20.255
You did it yourself.

00:06:20.255 --> 00:06:22.423
If Kamishina Jin was sitting
in the passenger seat,

00:06:22.423 --> 00:06:25.586
and hit you with his cuffs,
you'd have a bruise on your left side.

00:06:27.662 --> 00:06:30.665
If you had a left-hand drive car,
or Kamishina Jin were left-handed,

00:06:30.665 --> 00:06:34.869
that would be another story,
but unfortunately, the case is closed.

00:06:34.869 --> 00:06:40.175
Which means, you, Akira, being
right-handed, gave yourself that bruise.

00:06:40.175 --> 00:06:42.343
You let Kamishina Jin get away on purpose.

00:06:42.343 --> 00:06:44.646
Bingo, that's the right answer.

00:06:44.646 --> 00:06:48.449
Don't kid around! I don't
know what you were thinking,

00:06:48.449 --> 00:06:51.386
but I'm not going to let you
betray your friends like this!

00:06:51.386 --> 00:06:54.048
Next time you do this,
it's going to cost you!

00:06:55.657 --> 00:06:58.059
That's one charmless little kid.

00:06:58.059 --> 00:07:00.050
Yahoo!

00:07:01.729 --> 00:07:06.166
Sir! Please don't disturb the other guests!

00:07:09.504 --> 00:07:12.307
Everyone's going and
doing their own thing.

00:07:12.307 --> 00:07:14.809
I can't stand it when this happens.

00:07:14.809 --> 00:07:18.846
Young Miss, you look very becoming.

00:07:18.846 --> 00:07:20.677
Get real!

00:07:50.345 --> 00:07:51.937
I've spotted them.

00:07:55.016 --> 00:07:56.951
What do we do, Akira-chan?

00:07:56.951 --> 00:07:59.681
Let them go, so no one notices.

00:08:02.624 --> 00:08:04.626
Where could Gio have gone?

00:08:04.626 --> 00:08:06.561
I've found you!

00:08:06.561 --> 00:08:08.863
Now that we've spotted you,
you're done for!

00:08:08.863 --> 00:08:12.533
This time, you shall not escape from us!

00:08:12.533 --> 00:08:15.136
- Ah, geez...
- They've been spotted.

00:08:15.136 --> 00:08:18.435
It's no use struggling! Come quietly!

00:08:31.586 --> 00:08:34.088
- What do we do, Akira-chan?
- Machina!

00:08:34.088 --> 00:08:36.557
Let's pin them in!

00:08:36.557 --> 00:08:38.426
At this point, we have to fight.

00:08:38.426 --> 00:08:40.561
- But...
- Just pretend to.

00:08:40.561 --> 00:08:42.153
Got it.

00:08:45.967 --> 00:08:47.602
Gio!

00:08:47.602 --> 00:08:49.103
Jin, get Toa out, fast.

00:08:49.103 --> 00:08:51.506
- G-Gotcha!
- Whoa!

00:08:51.506 --> 00:08:53.667
You're not coming this way!

00:09:24.339 --> 00:09:26.641
Aren't you going to let us go this time?

00:09:26.641 --> 00:09:29.303
I can't today. Everyone is watching.

00:09:32.980 --> 00:09:35.049
Are you okay?

00:09:35.049 --> 00:09:36.884
Trapped like rats in a sack.

00:09:36.884 --> 00:09:38.875
Say your prayers!

00:09:44.792 --> 00:09:46.361
I'm going to Actualize.

00:09:46.361 --> 00:09:48.522
- Here?!
- Gio!

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:54.395
- Seize him!
- Stop!

00:10:14.155 --> 00:10:16.824
What are you doing?!

00:10:16.824 --> 00:10:19.156
Hurry up and grab him!

00:10:34.909 --> 00:10:36.911
Huh? What's that?

00:10:36.911 --> 00:10:39.539
- Jin!
- Toa!

00:10:42.517 --> 00:10:45.077
Young Miss!

00:11:18.986 --> 00:11:21.454
Where does she think she's going?

00:11:28.796 --> 00:11:30.423
Who's that?

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:36.103
Raina Cromwell?

00:11:36.103 --> 00:11:39.664
What's he doing here, with Garnet?

00:11:59.694 --> 00:12:01.321
Hey...

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:07.023
Hey... hey, are you okay?

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:18.110
W-What?

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:22.381
All right, I'll stay back.

00:12:23.951 --> 00:12:26.687
It looks like it's just us.

00:12:26.687 --> 00:12:28.956
Whatever, we have to get out of here.

00:12:28.956 --> 00:12:31.292
Do you know which way is out?

00:12:31.292 --> 00:12:34.028
Nope. I was knocked out.

00:12:34.028 --> 00:12:36.826
I don't know where we
washed in here from, either.

00:12:41.335 --> 00:12:45.740
This isn't much help. Kind of like you.

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:48.075
Well, excuse me for not being any help.

00:12:48.075 --> 00:12:50.908
In any case, we have to find the way out.

00:12:53.481 --> 00:12:55.073
What's wrong?

00:12:57.685 --> 00:12:59.312
Does it hurt?

00:13:02.657 --> 00:13:05.026
- Here.
- What?

00:13:05.026 --> 00:13:06.584
Just come on.

00:13:16.604 --> 00:13:18.339
Hey!

00:13:18.339 --> 00:13:20.864
J-Just a minute!

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:34.522
Are you hurt?

00:13:34.522 --> 00:13:36.422
It's you...

00:13:40.595 --> 00:13:42.363
Amadeus!

00:13:42.363 --> 00:13:44.263
Akira-chan, do you read me?

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:48.369
Young Miss!

00:13:48.369 --> 00:13:51.806
Calm down! Calm down, already!

00:13:51.806 --> 00:13:55.776
I just took my eyes off of
Young Miss for a moment!

00:13:55.776 --> 00:13:58.913
Ah, could she have gotten herself injured?

00:13:58.913 --> 00:14:02.583
I am certain that she is scared,
and crying somewhere.

00:14:02.583 --> 00:14:05.219
Who, her?

00:14:05.219 --> 00:14:07.622
Nasty.

00:14:07.622 --> 00:14:09.957
We can't go any farther this way.

00:14:09.957 --> 00:14:13.394
Looks like we'll have to turn back.

00:14:13.394 --> 00:14:15.062
Are you okay?

00:14:15.062 --> 00:14:16.597
I'm fine.

00:14:16.597 --> 00:14:18.132
This is nothing.

00:14:18.132 --> 00:14:20.601
Don't push yourself. Let's rest for a minute.

00:14:20.601 --> 00:14:22.470
I told you, I'm fine.

00:14:22.470 --> 00:14:24.631
Well, I'm tired.

00:14:50.464 --> 00:14:53.627
It's better this than
doing nothing at all, right?

00:14:58.139 --> 00:15:00.508
I'm sorry to have to bother you like this.

00:15:00.508 --> 00:15:03.102
We've got our own reasons.

00:15:11.952 --> 00:15:17.792
Don't worry. Once we get out
of here, I'll help you find Jin.

00:15:17.792 --> 00:15:19.384
Jin...

00:15:26.367 --> 00:15:29.370
This year's valedictorian,

00:15:29.370 --> 00:15:33.407
Sigelinde Baumgard.

00:15:33.407 --> 00:15:35.643
Just what you'd expect from
a 9-year-old genius girl

00:15:35.643 --> 00:15:37.478
who skips grades and gets into college.

00:15:37.478 --> 00:15:39.914
She's got that "it's only natural"
look on her face.

00:15:39.914 --> 00:15:42.483
There's nothing more galling than that look,

00:15:42.483 --> 00:15:45.720
making fools of the rest of us.

00:15:45.720 --> 00:15:48.522
She doesn't make any friends,
with her personality.

00:15:48.522 --> 00:15:50.658
All she does is study.

00:15:50.658 --> 00:15:53.388
She's bound to be a
loner from here on, too.

00:16:03.871 --> 00:16:05.930
Are you awake?

00:16:10.578 --> 00:16:12.913
We'd better have a doctor
look at that right away.

00:16:12.913 --> 00:16:15.616
Then, hurry and call one.

00:16:15.616 --> 00:16:19.053
I can't take this. Get me out of here, quick.

00:16:19.053 --> 00:16:22.356
It's all right. I'm sure we'll get out of here.

00:16:22.356 --> 00:16:26.861
I promise. So you can rest easy.

00:16:26.861 --> 00:16:31.398
You've changed a little.

00:16:31.398 --> 00:16:34.135
Before, you were just gloomy.

00:16:34.135 --> 00:16:35.536
And now?

00:16:35.536 --> 00:16:37.538
Gloomy and stupid.

00:16:37.538 --> 00:16:44.044
That's worse than before. I've been
showing fairly good improvement.

00:16:44.044 --> 00:16:47.948
I like it how things usually are.

00:16:47.948 --> 00:16:52.086
Usually, I'm not alone.

00:16:52.086 --> 00:16:55.990
People are never alone.

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:59.293
That's what I started
thinking when I met Toa.

00:16:59.293 --> 00:17:02.062
I...

00:17:02.062 --> 00:17:07.434
Someone will show up before long
and make you think so, too.

00:17:07.434 --> 00:17:09.403
Come on, let's get out of here.

00:17:09.403 --> 00:17:11.105
I can walk by myself.

00:17:11.105 --> 00:17:15.769
I just told you, you're not alone.
For now, just put up with me.

00:17:18.579 --> 00:17:22.583
Come to think of it, I still
don't know what your name is.

00:17:22.583 --> 00:17:24.084
I'm not telling.

00:17:24.084 --> 00:17:26.987
Huh? Why not?

00:17:26.987 --> 00:17:28.921
I'm just not.

00:17:47.308 --> 00:17:49.844
Sigelinde.

00:17:49.844 --> 00:17:53.180
That's my name.

00:17:53.180 --> 00:17:57.173
Sigelinde. That's a cute name.

00:17:59.520 --> 00:18:03.547
I have to rescue Young Miss,
as soon as possible!

00:18:07.061 --> 00:18:10.197
I am coming now, Young Miss!

00:18:10.197 --> 00:18:13.234
What are you doing? Calm down.

00:18:13.234 --> 00:18:15.725
Young Miss!

00:18:17.905 --> 00:18:22.376
All right. Let us take care of it.

00:18:22.376 --> 00:18:23.711
Come on, you too.

00:18:23.711 --> 00:18:26.547
This has nothing to do with me.

00:18:26.547 --> 00:18:29.209
You're not going to help
someone important to you?

00:18:32.152 --> 00:18:35.485
Pour it on!!

00:18:47.701 --> 00:18:51.228
If the water keeps rising like this,
we'll be able to get out through there.

00:18:53.908 --> 00:18:57.878
Hey, is the water level rising?!

00:18:57.878 --> 00:18:59.505
Someone's coming!

00:19:07.888 --> 00:19:10.057
Toa! Are you okay?!

00:19:10.057 --> 00:19:12.426
Gio!

00:19:12.426 --> 00:19:14.053
The water!

00:19:24.204 --> 00:19:25.694
Jin!

00:19:30.210 --> 00:19:31.768
Hurry.

00:19:54.101 --> 00:19:55.469
Akira-chan!

00:19:55.469 --> 00:19:57.271
M-Machina!

00:19:57.271 --> 00:19:58.898
Hold on to me!

00:20:28.135 --> 00:20:30.262
Y-Young Miss!

00:20:52.526 --> 00:20:55.362
I'll let you off this one time.

00:20:55.362 --> 00:20:58.465
You made me remember Amadeus, after all.

00:20:58.465 --> 00:21:00.467
Young Miss!

00:21:00.467 --> 00:21:04.571
Young Miss! Young Miss!

00:21:04.571 --> 00:21:06.300
Amadeus!

00:21:08.242 --> 00:21:11.234
Young Miss!

00:21:20.821 --> 00:21:25.492
You've had someone important
taken from you, too, huh?

00:21:25.492 --> 00:21:28.552
So have I.

00:21:30.030 --> 00:21:33.488
I will be your wings.

00:21:34.768 --> 00:21:38.038
Reading an Actualization!
Location, west coast of Kugajima,

00:21:38.038 --> 00:21:41.375
Point Alpha-23! I-It's...

00:21:41.375 --> 00:21:44.078
- It's Widow!
- Who is that riding her?!

00:21:44.078 --> 00:21:45.612
Tachibana Kazuki?! You're kidding!

00:21:45.612 --> 00:21:47.546
I-Impossible!

00:21:53.554 --> 00:21:56.723
Just you wait, Jin.

00:21:56.723 --> 00:21:59.954
I will get Gio back!

00:22:07.434 --> 00:22:14.108
The moment our eyes met,

00:22:14.108 --> 00:22:20.914
I felt like the sadness was beginning

00:22:20.914 --> 00:22:27.588
The memories that can't be blotted out

00:22:27.588 --> 00:22:34.790
bind our hearts together, even now

00:22:36.630 --> 00:22:43.470
Though there are as many people

00:22:43.470 --> 00:22:46.473
as there are in these thousands of stars,

00:22:46.473 --> 00:22:50.344
you're the only one that I can see

00:22:50.344 --> 00:22:53.514
Though we may not be able to meet,

00:22:53.514 --> 00:22:56.450
and our wishes might not be granted,

00:22:56.450 --> 00:23:02.756
our growing feelings
are sure to last forever

00:23:02.756 --> 00:23:09.763
If fate tears the two of us apart,

00:23:09.763 --> 00:23:16.603
I believe that just meeting
each other was a miracle

00:23:16.603 --> 00:23:23.177
Look how it flows, like this rain

00:23:23.177 --> 00:23:29.216
I want to let all of my affection fall on you

00:23:29.216 --> 00:23:33.448
Rain of Love

00:23:42.729 --> 00:23:45.165
This is ISDA operator Megumi!

00:23:45.165 --> 00:23:46.733
- And Ryoko!
- And Saki!

00:23:46.733 --> 00:23:48.869
I wanted to go to the hot springs, too.

00:23:48.869 --> 00:23:52.372
I know! If we go to the hot springs,
we might appear more!

00:23:52.372 --> 00:23:54.675
No way. Selling ourselves
cheap would ruin us.

00:23:54.675 --> 00:23:56.843
But we'd at least have a bigger part.

00:23:56.843 --> 00:23:59.546
Let us hold out hope that
we'll appear next time!

00:23:59.546 --> 00:24:03.083
Yeah, yeah! Now, let's take heart. Next time...

00:24:03.083 --> 00:24:06.653
Two people compete over him!
And a shocking confession!

00:24:06.653 --> 00:24:09.144
Ah, how romantic!
